  "description": "Jae-Hyeon's life was ruined by his stepmother, the woman who drove his mother to death and later caused his father's downfall. Consumed by hatred and forbidden desire, he takes revenge on her, only to die in a tragic accident. But fate has other plans... Awakening 25 years in the past, before his family’s destruction began, Jae-Hyeon must change the course of his life. Will he break free from his past, or repeat the same twisted destiny? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
